   |  User  | -------------------------------> |  DNS (foobar.com) |
   |(browser)| <------------------------------- |  www -> 8.8.8.8   |
   +--------+       2. answer: 8.8.8.8         +-------------------+
       |
       | 3. HTTP/HTTPS request (TCP/IP) to 8.8.8.8 (port 80/443)
       v
